OL,3,GNEWSAPub ready to reopen two years
OL,4,Aafter lorry smash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub closed since it was badly damaged
OL,7,Fby a lorry two years ago is due to
OL,8,Fre-open later this week.
OL,10,FBlack Country Ales bought the Three
OL,11,FFishes in Bayston Hill near Shrewsbury
OL,12,Fshortly before the crash in November
OL,13,F2024 and said it had carried out a
OL,14,F"substantial" rebuild.
OL,16,FSome of the pub was so badly damaged it
OL,17,Fhad to be pulled down and Black Country
OL,18,FAles said repairs did not begin until
OL,19,FApril this year, following lengthy
OL,20,Fnegotiations with insurers.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
